@{ ViewBag.Title = "About the community"; }
<section class="surface"><div class="eyebrow">ActiveCommunity Sports Council</div><h1>Local spaces. Shared possibilities.</h1><p class="lead">We make it easier to discover community sports facilities and organise your next session.</p><h3>Find a place for your sport</h3><p>Browse courts, fields and indoor halls by city and sport. Members can check opening hours and availability, request a reservation and manage their bookings in one place.</p><h3>Built around the community</h3><p>Read reviews from completed bookings, share your own experience and contact the council when you need help. Each booking request stays pending until an administrator confirms it.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Facilities")">Find your next game &rarr;</a></section>
